The original product/appearance model was purchased by the sponsoring company.
All referenced geometry inputs have therefore been cleared.
Bind your own skeleton, rings, guides, petals and light geometry to the named inputs.

STRUCTURAL BRANCH: 1/8 cyclic-sector proxy with 5 active elements.
DYNAMIC BRANCH: Assembly viewport preview + Dynamic Mechanism Report.
OPTICAL BRANCH: OpticalPreview + Optical Analysis Report.
